# aginx groups.desc — group key = one-line menu description (D13).
# File-is-registry: a package introduces a new group by appending a line
# here, no router reflash. Read by `aginx` at menu time; the
# AGINX_GROUPS_DESC env overrides for tests and the build-time --check
# gate.
agent=avatar addressing and conversation (front-desk faces)
dev=developer and trial-run faces
